hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2891","###\n Narrated to us by Salam ibn Junadah, who narrated from Waki', who narrated from Isra'il, who narrated from Ibrahim ibn Muhajir, who narrated from Yusuf ibn Mahak, who narrated from his mother Musaykah, who narrated from Aisha (RA), who said: A man said, \O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"," shall we not build a structure in Mina to provide you with shade?\"" He (ﷺ) said: \""No"," Mina is a camping ground for whoever arrives"""
